SUMMARY:Frisket: an AI-powered spreadsheet for investigations
DESCRIPTION:Frisket is an open-source\, AI-powered spreadsheet for investig
 ative reporting. Throw in a disorganized mountain of PDFs\, transcripts\, 
 audio\, video\, emails or spreadsheets\, then use AI to search\, sort\, cl
 assify\, and cross-reference your way through the mess! Instead of bouncin
 g between Pinpoint\, NotebookLM\, pandas\, and a half-dozen other tools\, 
 Frisket brings everything together into one (painfully complicated?) inter
 face.\nJoin the call: https://meet.google.com/evq-jfrb-wmc\nEvent page: ht
 tps://datafrosch.fun/events/frisket-ai-spreadsheet.html
